|-------------------|------------------------|
| `e` is `null`/`undefined` | `e?.` stops the chain |
| No feature under the cursor | `features?.[0]` → `undefined` → early return |
| Feature has no `properties` | `properties?.` → `undefined` → early return |
| `info` key missing or `null` | `rawInfo` falsy → early return |
| `info` is a malformed JSON string | `try / catch` around `JSON.parse` |
| Individual fields missing | `??` supplies sensible defaults |
| Field is the wrong type (e.g., `status` not a string) | `?.toUpperCase?.()` prevents a crash |

